/-!
# A182631

Tetrahedron in which T(i,j,k) is the next number congruent to k mod j of the level j in the slice i, with 0 <= i, 1 <= j, 0 <= k < j.

The 84 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `0`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

